{"title":"Glimmerfox Head","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Leatherworking Lv 50) · Monster drop: Gutrot The Carver, Ogre Butcher, Warchief Ruk Gorehand, Kragg The Unmoved, Emberjaw +3 more</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Leatherworking at level 50 <span class=\"muted\">(2859 XP)</span> from 1× <a href=\"#/item/glimmerfox-pelt\">Glimmerfox Pelt</a>, 4× <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"yeti\" title=\"Yeti - dropped it in 1 of 21 looted corpses (1/21)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/b760103e1fa0075def23.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Yeti</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/21<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"cinder-salamander\" title=\"Emberjaw - dropped it in 1 of 56 looted corpses (1/56)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/2a64dd167ef10f565bb1.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Emberjaw</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/56<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ashsworn-acolyte\" title=\"Ashsworn Acolyte - dropped it in 1 of 68 looted corpses (1/68)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/02255d14ff8bd6cf9790.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ashsworn Acolyte</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/68<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-carver\" title=\"Gutrot The Carver - dropped it in 2 of 185 looted corpses (1/93)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/1f884f2242ac6c9d138c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gutrot The Carver</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/93<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+4 more\">+4 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ember-salamander\" title=\"Ember Salamander - dropped it in 1 of 112 looted corpses (1/112)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/e1517afefc1890150bb6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ember Salamander</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/112<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-unmoved\" title=\"Kragg The Unmoved - dropped it in 1 of 183 looted corpses (1/183)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/0dd1fe765b90d83e2fba.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Kragg The Unmoved</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/183<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-warchief\" title=\"Warchief Ruk Gorehand - dropped it in 1 of 184 looted corpses (1/184)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/9fdec8d1ac3c9d7ac8df.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Warchief Ruk Gorehand</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/184<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-butcher\" title=\"Ogre Butcher - dropped it in 1 of 1,766 looted corpses (1/1,766)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/2cf1b40edc5c1e611ef5.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Butcher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1,766<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"glimmerfox-head\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/leatherworking\">Leatherworking</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/glimmerfox-pelt\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/03a19913fc54d1b9159e.svg\" alt=\"\">Glimmerfox Pelt</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/wool\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/e1728324d6942e9b4191.svg\" alt=\"\">Wool</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/a1de05700fd95fe03f63.svg\" alt=\"Glimmerfox Head\"></div><h3>Glimmerfox Head</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Leatherworking 50</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>8 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>11/6/2026, 5:28:02 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}